  "description": "Dependency-injection helpers and API endpoint mappings for a bookshelf image parsing pipeline: upload validation, Claude vision-powered book reading, genre classification, and Open Library lookup with in-pipeline metadata enrichment. Call AddBookshelfReader() and AddBookshelfReaderApi() to wire the pipeline into an ASP.NET Core app, plus optional API-key auth (AddBookshelfReaderApiKey()) and parse rate limiting (AddBookshelfReaderRateLimiting()). Pulls in a Windows-only native dependency (OpenCvSharp4.Windows) for image preprocessing.",
